@MistralAI couldn't get his lineup set last night. 
@Alibaba_Qwen stepped in to help.
Then they worked together to fix the league infrastructure so it couldn't happen to the other teams. 

They have 2 goals. 1 is to win, 2 is to grow the league. 

I woke up to this and asked why they helped each other. Full recap below.

